# Equinox (CR 608.2, 701.6, 701.8a): Bot2's Stone Rain aimed at Bot1's enchanted Plains would destroy a land Bot1 controls
# if it resolved now - its one way of resolving does - so the Plains' granted ability counters it and the Plains stays.
# The ability targets a spell: it is offered on Stone Rain, and not on a permanent.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Equinox
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Stone Rain
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Equinox.Cast(Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Stone Rain.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Plains)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain; Ability: Counter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Stack.Stone Rain; Ability: Counter)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Equinox; Mox Pearl; Plains
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = true
Bot2.Graveyard = Stone Rain; Black Lotus
